## 3. Scripting a Multi-Threaded Statistical Validation Test
To manually test if a registration endpoint or promo-handler is mathematically vulnerable to a concurrency race condition, you can write an optimized execution script using asynchronous Python threads.
This script maps out a synchronized multi-thread blast designed to force all requests to hit the server's input pipeline simultaneously, testing if the backend code handles thread locks properly.

